### Campus Marketplace — Authentication Flow Manual Verification (CMP-6)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@schoolEmail = sv01@stu.ptit.edu.vn
@otpCode = 123456
@otpTicket = paste_otp_ticket_from_verify_otp_response
@password = StudentPass123!

### 1. Request University Email OTP (200 OK — SimpleMessageResponse)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{schoolEmail}}"
}

### 2. Verify OTP Code (200 OK — VerifyOtpResponse { otpTicket, expiresIn })
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{schoolEmail}}",
  "code": "{{otpCode}}"
}

### 3. Register Account (201 Created — AuthSessionResponse, verificationStatus = PENDING)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "otpTicket": "{{otpTicket}}",
  "displayName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 4. Login (200 OK — AuthSessionResponse)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{schoolEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

